{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list for dexmedetomidine hydrochloride injection has been current since 2020-04-10 and includes multiple manufacturers; no public FDA signal at our plants",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21", "D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows dexmedetomidine hydrochloride injection as Current with an initial posting date of 2020-04-10 and an update date of 2026-09-15 for Accord Healthcare Inc. citing discontinuation of manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additional manufacturers on the Current list include Amneal Pharmaceuticals (update 2026-10-06), Azurity Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (update 2026-10-15), Baxter Healthcare (update 2026-10-16), Eugia US LLC (update 2026-10-19), Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC (update 2026-10-15), Gland Pharma Limited (update 2026-07-22), Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc. (update 2026-10-14), HQ Specialty Pharma (update 2026-10-01), Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co. (US Agent eVenus Pharmaceutical Laboratories, Inc.) (update 2026-10-14), Jiangsu Hengrui Pharmaceuticals Co., Ltd. (update 2026-10-05), and Meitheal Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (update 2026-08-27).",
      "cites": ["E11", "E12", "E13", "E14", "E15", "E16", "E17", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E21"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 78 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our supply of the 100 ug/mL, 2 mL vial (NDC 0143-9532-25) is labeled Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. at both Corvale East and Corvale General.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no public FDA inspection classification (OAI, VAI, or NAI) or other public FDA signal reported for the plants supplying our sites.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 59 vials at 7.1 per day for 8.3 days on hand; Corvale General holds 159 vials at 7.7 per day for 20.6 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D4", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 41 vials of 100 ug/mL, 2 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would leave Corvale General with 15 days and bring Corvale East to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
}
